# docvia codegen. `.docvia/` is the compiled module graph plus its incremental
# cache; `docvia-env.d.ts` is the ambient type for `virtual:docvia/source`.
# Both are regenerated by `docvia build` (wired into `pnpm check`) and by the
# dev server, so they are outputs, not sources — same treatment as `.svelte-kit`.
.docvia/
docvia-env.d.ts
.vercel
.env*.local

# Generated from packages/application/assets (see scripts/sync-screenshot-assets.mjs)
/static/screenshot-assets/
